WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.362
Part 1 is the build.

2
00:00:01.362 --> 00:00:04.494
We'll size the cluster and
make it highly available,

3
00:00:04.494 --> 00:00:08.967
be careful about what we claim for
FIPS, set up how administrators sign in,

4
00:00:08.967 --> 00:00:11.640
harden it, and make sure
it can be recovered.
